Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI发布Imagine Image 2.0模型，支持5张参考图融合与智能扩图</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI拟于8月发布10万亿参数GPT-6，年底将推出代号Doug的超大规模模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google Chrome 与微软 Edge 提升本地 AI 模型磁盘空间需求至 20GB</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果Apple智能迎来重大升级：Siri正式接入阿里千问大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5501df55e35a0976c4641b4c1ea4de89.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果官方更新Mac使用手册，宣布国内版Apple智能正式接入阿里巴巴千问大模型。搭载macOS 26.6及以上系统的国行Mac设备，在开启相关权限后，Siri的智能程度与功能上限显著提升。此次升级使Siri具备了更深度的复杂请求处理能力，并新增照片与文稿分析功能，系统内置写作工具也支持文本创作与图像生成。该功能目前仅面向三类用户开放：Apple账户地区设置为中国大陆的用户、未登录Apple账户的国内用户，以及购买国行Mac机型的用户。海外版Mac即便升级系统也无法使用此功能。此次合作使国内用户在办公、图文创作及生活问答场景中，可直接依托本机AI高效处理，无需频繁切换第三方软件，国行版本在本地AI体验上形成了差异化优势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布首款开源全双工语音模型NemotronLabs VoiceChat 11B</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式推出首款开源端到端全双工语音对话模型NemotronLabs VoiceChat 11B。该模型摒弃了传统的ASR、LLM与TTS分步架构，采用统一网络实现流式语音理解与生成，平滑轮换延迟低至448毫秒，支持边听边说的全双工交互及中途插话响应。作为首个支持对话中工具调用的开源全双工模型，其引入了独立输出通道与预置“保持”话术机制，可有效处理API调用期间的静默问题。目前该模型仅限研究用途，部署需单张至少80GB显存的高性能GPU，暂未提供托管API。尽管存在长上下文及多轮对话的局限性，但其开放权重与容器设计为联络中心、汽车座舱及智能辅助等领域的开发者提供了新的工程化探索路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI发布Imagine Image 2.0模型，支持5张参考图融合与智能扩图</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c138c3b3dcce9a3a8be97700f726221b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">xAI正式上线Imagine Image 2.0，作为Grok旗下Web端及移动端应用的新一代质量模式，重点提升了复杂指令理解、字体布局规划及小尺寸文字清晰度。该模型支持一次融合最多5张参考图，并提供魔棒与分割工具实现精准局部编辑，同时具备背景移除与透明图像导出功能。新增的智能调整大小功能支持1:2至9:16等多种画幅比例扩展。针对电商、角色设计等场景，xAI推出了模板工作流，确保多轮生成中的视觉风格一致性。在Arena评测中，grok-imagine-image-2在文生图与图像编辑任务中均位列全球第二，得分分别为1320分与1439分。目前该模型API访问计划正在推进中，尚未正式对外开放。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI拟于8月发布10万亿参数GPT-6，年底将推出代号Doug的超大规模模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI计划于8月发布代号为Astra的GPT-6模型，该模型参数规模预计达10万亿，约为GPT-4的五倍以上。此次发布标志着OpenAI在经历两年模型底座未更新后，正式完成预训练发动机的换代。除GPT-6外，OpenAI预计在11月前推出代号为Doug的更大规模预训练模型，该模型或采用英伟达下一代Vera Rubin芯片进行训练，旨在突破Scaling Laws瓶颈并巩固行业领先地位。此前，OpenAI通过Garlic验证实验克服了十万卡集群的稳定性难题。面对Anthropic旗下Fable 5.1的竞争，OpenAI通过GPT-6与Doug的组合拳布局，意图在ASI领域确立绝对优势。此举反映了硅谷在高性能计算与前沿模型研发上的激烈博弈，行业关注焦点已转向预训练规模的再次跃升。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google Chrome 与微软 Edge 提升本地 AI 模型磁盘空间需求至 20GB</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f7974d8b0300cd6534ce38c1aa17cac3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google Chrome 与微软 Edge 浏览器近期更新官方要求，将本地 AI 模型运行的空闲磁盘空间门槛提升至 20GB。此次调整旨在支持设备端 AI 功能，以降低延迟并保护隐私。除存储要求外，Edge 浏览器还增设了至少 5.5GB GPU 显存的硬件门槛。若设备可用存储空间降至 10GB 以下，Edge 会自动删除模型以保障浏览器运行。目前，用户可通过 Chrome 设置中的系统页面关闭设备端 AI 功能。这一变化标志着浏览器正从网页渲染工具向 AI 推理引擎转型，但模型体积的五倍增长对 256GB 及以下容量的轻薄本构成了显著存储压力。厂商需在 AI 功能丰富度与硬件资源占用间寻求平衡，以避免因高门槛导致用户关闭相关功能。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
